{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0253_1000_p", "source_sha256": "bea8001f2fd7f3a0207e549a12fac5c819d548489f160ec9f7d9f37d98749c8b", "ja": "（ネクスト・アイドル・ウェーブの参加ユニットが\n確定した。今日はマスコミ向けのお披露目会だ）", "zh": "（参加下一届偶像浪潮的组合已经确定了。今天是面向媒体的亮相会）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0253_1001_014mir", "source_sha256": "8123dd04b96bbff698b314e885950488340f96a029bdcc17d663ff759833b304", "ja": "準備運動ー、いっちに、いっちにー。", "zh": "热身运动——一、二，一、二——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0253_1002_014mir", "source_sha256": "29fae92a0a5a8fda571c944ea032236df5d893cddb524472f75bec2d06513dd4", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん！\n私の衣装、ヘンなところないですか？", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n我的服装没有什么奇怪的地方吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0253_1003_p", "source_sha256": "d656937370d09a26d779f650d3da8c84102128822692b570318822e67d4920d3", "ja": "ああ、問題ないよ。\n……うん。未来はいつもどおり、元気だな！", "zh": "啊，没问题。\n……嗯。未来还是一如既往地有精神！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0253_1004_014mir", "source_sha256": "1ee3fdda031cbdf1fb5b0382587340778e18e8d397027363e645a45c245e903d", "ja": "いつもどおり……そう見えますか？", "zh": "和平时一样……看起来是这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0253_1005_p", "source_sha256": "11675e9bae1f634eae844a6d1c6538d0a3fe09c5962c2955d7a5694ce893f6d4", "ja": "えっ、違うのか？\n緊張してる……ようには見えないけど。", "zh": "诶，不是吗？\n看起来……不像是在紧张。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0253_1006_014mir", "source_sha256": "88d6656bdc431e363821ffecac76f0e8c9b3e412e5971428d62c594f5e3dab6e", "ja": "緊張はしてないです！　……あれ？\nだから私って、緊張感がないのかな……？", "zh": "我没有紧张！……咦？\n所以我是不是没有紧张感啊……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0253_1007_p", "source_sha256": "9c98af1108aae987de649551034900f45ac6169d10ef6ea99ab9c501392b39a1", "ja": "どうかしたのか？", "zh": "怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0253_1008_014mir", "source_sha256": "bc9a7626947d97467542b2fa6f252ce3fd2054e9584c79963d1cf1acf7a731a6", "ja": "えっと……さっき、翼とはしゃいでて、\n静香ちゃんに怒られたばっかりなんです。", "zh": "那个……刚才和翼玩得太闹腾，才被静香训了一顿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0253_1009_014mir", "source_sha256": "b997980617721efd403032f9048439d79b48ca2b9bcc32da1c96a4139f6c2eff", "ja": "「今日は取材の人達がたくさん来るんだから、\nすこしは緊張感を持ちなさい！」って。だから……。", "zh": "“今天会有很多媒体的人过来，\n稍微有点紧张感好不好！”这样。所以……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0253_1010_p", "source_sha256": "461df67dbcb18025c057809837c6d07afd001b03b3a1ae8a6dbf45a65acf22b8", "ja": "はは、そうだったのか。でも、アイドルが\nいつも楽しそうに見えるのはいい事だと思うよ。", "zh": "哈哈，原来是这样啊。不过，我觉得偶像总是看起来很开心，是件好事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0253_1011_014mir", "source_sha256": "d586b0ba81b875255e219d49f734a78834c881ff31b2ec2e918da09bf4bdfc8c", "ja": "そうですよね！　{$P$}さん、\n取材の人って、どれくらい来るんですか？", "zh": "就是嘛！{$P$}先生，采访的人会来多少啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0253_1012_p", "source_sha256": "349381ec0d0d6b863e9e4acbd1bcb138702a0687c9276a91ae95e960f68de54e", "ja": "そうだな……何しろネクスト・アイドル・ウェーブの\n取材だからな。何十人と集まるかもしれないな……。", "zh": "是啊……毕竟是Next偶像Wave的采访。说不定会有几十个人聚集过来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0253_1013_014mir", "source_sha256": "bd2c0f4d815b61af138975fca53df5db24de3b463873178a3fdd28807a72f1ab", "ja": "そんなに！？　わぁ……私、\nなんだかすっごく楽しみになってきました！", "zh": "有那么多人！？哇……我突然变得特别期待了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0253_1014_p", "source_sha256": "1bd11c5b44981703eafc31f93a304e43eb152f42358228eca43aa705a24e999d", "ja": "楽しみ……そうなのか？", "zh": "期待……是这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0253_1015_014mir", "source_sha256": "89eea44dd62b439b4e051c156e1d076416616aa38a89437cf8c00cd4547cc441", "ja": "はい！　緊張よりも、ワクワクするっていうか！\n知らないボタンを押す時もそうですけど……。", "zh": "是的！与其说是紧张，不如说是让人兴奋期待！\n就像按下从没见过的按钮时一样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0253_1016_014mir", "source_sha256": "2e401b3627c867b4cc3d10cb4fb1dc2ad92db7cb6159ca23d8c544fda3802535", "ja": "それに、今日も{$P$}さんが\nいてくれるから、きっと何が起こっても平気です♪", "zh": "而且，今天还有{$P$}先生陪着我，所以不管发生什么，我肯定都没问题♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0253_1017_p", "source_sha256": "867885301500ed44f0623816db8afbef0eda3374678013865c344cea8a97d274", "ja": "そうか……未来は肝が据わってるっていうか、\n度胸があるな。さすが代表ユニットのセンターだ。", "zh": "这样啊……未来该说是沉得住气，还是说胆量十足呢。不愧是代表性组合的中心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0253_1018_014mir", "source_sha256": "109187052bd62e5bdcf4f1b5eb721b92f696a4590032e73482da86b7c40db203", "ja": "え～、それほどでも……でへへ♪", "zh": "诶～也没那么夸张啦……嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0253_1019_014mir", "source_sha256": "3ba61b25e86778a8c4aec8b450519b00191c2edbaa32c5dac8d663f1e89dd5dd", "ja": "でも今回は、センターに選んでもらったし。\n気合いを入れて、がんばろうと思います！", "zh": "不过这次被选为C位了。\n所以我想打起精神，好好加油！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0253_1020_014mir", "source_sha256": "55bcc8e66139ca838d38a127240048af3d59316215e3a744a02711f554515be8", "ja": "そうじゃないと、静香ちゃんや翼に、\n怒られちゃいますからね！", "zh": "不然的话，会被静香和翼骂的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0253_1021_p", "source_sha256": "4a1ca953cc943e54e197453e8be1f4f88afc776db06db1756ff3f5b279fe1e27", "ja": "ああ、頼んだぞ！\n……と思ったけど、何か違和感が……。", "zh": "啊，拜托你了！\n……本来是这么想的，可总觉得有些不对劲……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0253_1022_014mir", "source_sha256": "4c0b6a889ae6e5c25527e2505fd9315882cab997f13eb8e98202f5fab2a06211", "ja": "どうしたんですか、{$P$}さん？", "zh": "怎么了吗，{$P$}先生？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0253_1023_p", "source_sha256": "2a21c48b4db8c2e2f80c65e8fe9903ae5b8bc877de5d3b0363669a2f5b55407c", "ja": "未来、その足元……もしかして、\nレッスン用の靴じゃないか？", "zh": "未来，你脚下那双鞋……难道是练习用的鞋？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0253_1024_014mir", "source_sha256": "c7254e7022f963eb1a151fbbd2f61a59acf2a826bc53cd93fdd547ae7af30c3d", "ja": "本当だ！　ど、どうしよう、履き替えなきゃ……\nああっ！？　靴ひも、カチカチに結んじゃってました！", "zh": "真的！怎、怎么办，得换鞋才行……\n啊！？鞋带居然系得死死的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0253_1025_p", "source_sha256": "ee403de969358b2c7a94e1b4a749941aa190a4cb409427899942983e16ad4e47", "ja": "大丈夫だ未来、いったん落ち着こう！\nまだ間に合うから！", "zh": "没事的未来，先冷静下来！\n还来得及！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0253_1026_p", "source_sha256": "a0bd6b646a63adc610410b6a475f00073dce0495bcd7d670af6d08fba941e215", "ja": "（しっかりしたと思ったけど、まだまだだな……\n少しずつ確実に進もう。まずは、靴を直してから！）", "zh": "（本以为未来已经变得可靠了，看来还差得远啊……一步一步稳稳地前进吧。先把鞋子修好再说！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
